{"lemma":"יָדָה","translit":"ya.dah","gloss":"to give thanks","tbesh_subentries":[],"tbesh_html":"1) to throw, shoot, cast<br>1a) (Qal) to shoot (arrows)<br>1b) (Piel) to cast, cast down, throw down<br>1c) (Hiphil)<br>1c1) to give thanks, laud, praise<br>1c2) to confess, confess (the name of God)<br>1d) (Hithpael)<br>1d1) to confess (sin)<br>1d2) to give thanks<BR>Aramaic equivalent: <i>ye.da</i> (יְדָא \"to praise\" H3029)","tbesh_key":"H3034","strongs_1890":{"strongs_def":"physically, to throw (a stone, an arrow) at or away; especially to revere or worship (with extended hands); intensively, to bemoan (by wringing the hands)","derivation":"a primitive root; used only as denominative from H3027 (יָד); literally, to use (i.e. hold out) the hand;","kjv_def":"cast (out), (make) confess(-ion), praise, shoot, (give) thank(-ful, -s, -sgiving)."},"count":114,"occurrences":[["Gen.29.35",1],["Gen.49.8",1],["Lev.5.5",1],["Lev.16.21",1],["Lev.26.40",1],["Num.5.7",1],["2Sa.22.50",1],["1Ki.8.33",1],["1Ki.8.35",1],["1Ch.16.4",1],["1Ch.16.7",1],["1Ch.16.8",1],["1Ch.16.34",1],["1Ch.16.35",1],["1Ch.16.41",1],["1Ch.23.30",1],["1Ch.25.3",1],["1Ch.29.13",1],["2Ch.5.13",1],["2Ch.6.24",1],["2Ch.6.26",1],["2Ch.7.3",1],["2Ch.7.6",1],["2Ch.20.21",1],["2Ch.30.22",1],["2Ch.31.2",1],["Ezr.3.11",1],["Ezr.10.1",1],["Neh.1.6",1],["Neh.9.2",1],["Neh.9.3",1],["Neh.11.17",1],["Neh.12.24",1],["Neh.12.46",1],["Job.40.14",1],["Psa.6.5",1],["Psa.7.17",1],["Psa.9.1",1],["Psa.18.49",1],["Psa.28.7",1],["Psa.30.4",1],["Psa.30.9",1],["Psa.30.12",1],["Psa.32.5",1],["Psa.33.2",1],["Psa.35.18",1],["Psa.42.5",1],["Psa.42.11",1],["Psa.43.4",1],["Psa.43.5",1],["Psa.44.8",1],["Psa.45.17",1],["Psa.49.18",1],["Psa.52.9",1],["Psa.54.6",1],["Psa.57.9",1],["Psa.67.3",2],["Psa.67.5",2],["Psa.71.22",1],["Psa.75.1",2],["Psa.76.10",1],["Psa.79.13",1],["Psa.86.12",1],["Psa.88.10",1],["Psa.89.5",1],["Psa.92.1",1],["Psa.97.12",1],["Psa.99.3",1],["Psa.100.4",1],["Psa.105.1",1],["Psa.106.1",1],["Psa.106.47",1],["Psa.107.1",1],[